  - m_Id: 318406324224
    m_Localized: Control - Gamepad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 353672032256
    m_Localized: Upgrades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397284405248
    m_Localized: 'Health Item Density: Health items spawn faster and the item cap
      increases.

      Increase Health: Increase max health and restore the same
      amount immediately.

      Tilt Boost: Increase boosted tilt angle and lift
      impulse.

      Push Cooldown: Reduce the push ability cooldown.

      Push
      Power: Increase the impulse applied by the push ability.

      Push Range:
      Increases the radius of push force field.

      Catch Breath: Pause enemy
      for several seconds.

      Luck: Boost drops of health and increases damage
      damp when touched with enemy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
